usly Assaulting the three closest creatures, regardless of whether or not the creatures are Ebirath's allies.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"bcU3JaTNt9e7cKg0","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687401671237,"modifiedTime":1687401690087,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Furious Assault","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Ebirath makes a big claw Strike and then two Strikes with either its little claw or its tail. If Ebirath makes all the attacks against different creatures, it doesn't apply the multiple attack penalty until after all the Strikes are complete. Otherwise, it applies the multiple attack penalty normally.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"7pds01YGPacWTX4W","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687401700140,"modifiedTime":1687401722205,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Sonic Claw Snap","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Ebirath doesn't have a creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} using its big claw's Improved Grab</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Snapping its big claw, Ebirath produces a blast of powerful sound waves in a @Template[type:burst|distance:20] within 40 feet, dealing @Damage[5d10[sonic]] damage. All creatures within range must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:40] saving throw, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Deafened]{Deafened} for 1 round, and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 3}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"eap1L99fdo4Mpi57","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687401700837,"modifiedTime":1691261014033,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542898196,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"lydM8mSFIZEmOt0U","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":7300000}